SUMMARY:PCA Chats at Frist Late Meal
LOCATION:Frist Campus Center\, A level
DESCRIPTION:Do you have questions about resumes\, cover letters\, LinkedI
 n\, networking or internship searches? Curious how the Center for Career
  Development supports students? Stop by and talk to Peer Career Advisers
  (PCAs) who are trained by the Center for Career Development. They can a
