SUMMARY:Workbuddy x ACSSPU
DESCRIPTION:How does an AI productivity tool go from an idea to something
  people use every day? ACSSOU is excited to host a product manager from 
 Tencent to walk through the design and development of WorkBuddy\, an AI 
 agent for everyday work tasks\, as a case study: the user problems it se
 t out to solve\, the design decisions and trade-offs along the way\, and
  lessons from building an AI product in practice. A moderated Q&A follow
 s\, covering product design\, AI applications\, user experience\, and wh
 at working on AI products looks like day to day. In the second half\, pa
 rticipants can try the tool on their own lap\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/
 events/2026/workbuddy-x-acsspu
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/workbuddy-x-acsspu
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
END:VEVENT
