 ring spaces\, university services\, and large-scale receiving operations
  on a steep\, active campus site? Walk the complex with us and explore t
 he planning\, structure\, logistics\, and design decisions that make ES&
 SEAS a sustainable building complex. Some specific feature we will explo
 re: the hybrid structural strategy: mass timber in offices and shared sp
 aces\, and steel and concrete where laboratories require tighter vibrati
 on control\, resulting in a lower embodied carbon building daylighting s
