SUMMARY:Sex\, Science\, and Storytelling
DESCRIPTION:The biology of sex is complex\, diverse\, important\, and all
  too often misunderstood. This event brings together scientists\, author
 s\, artists\, and communicators who both document the richness and diver
 sity of sex across the animal kingdom (including humans) and provide exc
 ellent examples of how to best get that knowledge into the world.\nhttps
 ://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/sex-science-and-storytelling
