SUMMARY:Using R with ArcGIS Pro
DESCRIPTION:Esri has developed the R-ArcGIS Bridge to support data transf
 er and analysis between ArcGIS Pro and R. Based on a Rice University wor
 kshop\, this session uses ArcGIS Pro and R-Studio to analyze gun-related
  arrests in Philadelphia in 2021. Users will learn how to connect R to A
 rcGIS Pro and how to install the arcgisbinding package. Data in ArcGIS P
 ro will be ported into R-Studio\, where a statistical analysis will be p
 erformed. The results will be ported back into ArcGIS Pro for further an
 alysis. Students will use ArcGIS Pro\, R-Studio and R installed on the c
 lassroom’s Windows computers. This eve\nhttps://www.princeton.edu/even
 ts/2026/using-r-arcgis-pro-0
URL:https://www.princeton.edu/events/2026/using-r-arcgis-pro-0
STATUS:CONFIRMED
