SUMMARY:"Hearing Math" with Sandeep Das\, Tabla
DESCRIPTION:Conceptualized and produced by Grammy-winning tabla artist Sa
 ndeep Das\, “Hearing Math” is a dynamic project exploring how to mak
 e mathematical concepts audible—and the math in music tangible—throu
 gh a collaboration between Indian Classical Music and mathematics. In ad
 dition to the artistic and creative possibilities\, the long-term goal o
 f this initiative is to develop a learning and pedagogical mindset where
  STEM concepts and music are taught in tandem. This Princeton iteration 
 of “Hearing Math” is presented jointly by Princeton University Conce
 rts and the Princeton University Department of Ma\nhttps://www.princeton
 .edu/events/2026/hearing-math-sandeep-das-tabla
